    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25458" root="ضبث" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاقةٌ ضَبُوثٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>A she-camel of which one doubts
whether she be fat, and which one therefore feels
with the hand:</i> (S, A, K:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاقَةٌ ضَغُوثٌ</span>.
(S and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضغث</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضَّبُوثُ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُبَاثٌ</span>.

